	ing reception of Learning Curve 18\, an annual exhibition of selected work
	 made by HCP’s students from the past year. From digital to alternative pr
	ocesses\, the exhibition highlights HCP Education’s various educational pr
	ograms.\n\nhttps://www.edu.hcponline.org/events/learning-curve-18-opening-
	reception\n\nFrom Houston Center for Photography
